{"text":"kuruntokai","n":249,"lines":["இனமயில் அகவு மரம்பயில் கானத்து","நரைமுக ஊகம் பார்ப்பொடு பனிப்பப்","படுமழை பொழிந்த சாரலவர் நாட்டுக்","குன்ற நோக்கினென் தோழி","பண்டை யற்றோ கண்டிசின் நுதலே"],"tr":["iṉamayil akavu marampayil kāṉattu","naraimuka ūkam pārppoṭu paṉippap","paṭumaḻai poḻinta cāralavar nāṭṭuk","kuṉṟa nōkkiṉeṉ tōḻi","paṇṭai yaṟṟō kaṇṭiciṉ nutalē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 6, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இனமயில்","tr":"iṉamayil","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இன","tr":"iṉa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மயில்","tr":"mayil"}]},{"text":"அகவு","tr":"akavu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அக","tr":"aka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வு","tr":"vu"}]},{"text":"மரம்பயில்","tr":"marampayil","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரம்","tr":"maram"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பயில்","tr":"payil"}]},{"text":"கானத்து","tr":"kāṉattu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னத்","tr":"ṉat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"நரைமுக","tr":"naraimuka","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நரை","tr":"narai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முக","tr":"muka"}]},{"text":"ஊகம்","tr":"ūkam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊ","tr":"ū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கம்","tr":"kam"}]},{"text":"பார்ப்பொடு","tr":"pārppoṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பார்ப்","tr":"pārp"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொடு","tr":"poṭu"}]},{"text":"பனிப்பப்","tr":"paṉippap","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பனிப்","tr":"paṉip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பப்","tr":"pap"}]}],[{"text":"படுமழை","tr":"paṭumaḻai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மழை","tr":"maḻai"}]},{"text":"பொழிந்த","tr":"poḻinta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொழிந்","tr":"poḻin"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"சாரலவர்","tr":"cāralavar","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரல","tr":"rala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வர்","tr":"var"}]},{"text":"நாட்டுக்","tr":"nāṭṭuk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டுக்","tr":"ṭuk"}]}],[{"text":"குன்ற","tr":"kuṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"நோக்கினென்","tr":"nōkkiṉeṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோக்","tr":"nōk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கினென்","tr":"kiṉeṉ"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]}],[{"text":"பண்டை","tr":"paṇṭai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பண்","tr":"paṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"}]},{"text":"யற்றோ","tr":"yaṟṟō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யற்","tr":"yaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோ","tr":"ṟō"}]},{"text":"கண்டிசின்","tr":"kaṇṭiciṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிசின்","tr":"ṭiciṉ"}]},{"text":"நுதலே","tr":"nutalē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுத","tr":"nuta"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இனமயில்","parts":[{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"flock"},{"text":"மயில்","lemma":"மயில்","gloss":"peacock"}],"gloss":"flock of peacocks"},{"surface":"அகவும்","parts":[{"text":"அகவும்","lemma":"அகவு","gloss":"calling"}],"gloss":"calling"},{"surface":"மரம்பயில்","parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"மரம்","gloss":"tree"},{"text":"பயில்","lemma":"பயில்","gloss":"crowded"}],"gloss":"tree-crowded"},{"surface":"கானத்து","parts":[{"text":"கானத்து","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest-oblique"}],"gloss":"of the forest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நரைமுக","parts":[{"text":"நரைமுக","lemma":"நரைமுகம்","gloss":"grey-faced"}],"gloss":"grey-faced"},{"surface":"ஊகம்","parts":[{"text":"ஊகம்","lemma":"ஊகம்","gloss":"black monkey"}],"gloss":"black monkey"},{"surface":"பார்ப்பொடு","parts":[{"text":"பார்ப்பு","lemma":"பார்ப்பு","gloss":"young one"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with its young one"},{"surface":"பனிப்ப","parts":[{"text":"பனிப்ப","lemma":"பனிப்ப","gloss":"to shiver"}],"gloss":"shivering"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"படுமழை","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"heavy"},{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"heavy rain"},{"surface":"பொழிந்த","parts":[{"text":"பொழிந்த","lemma":"பொழி","gloss":"poured"}],"gloss":"poured"},{"surface":"சாரலவர்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"},{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"of his mountain slopes"},{"surface":"நாட்டு","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"country-oblique"}],"gloss":"of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"குன்றம்","lemma":"குன்றம்","gloss":"hill"}],"gloss":"hill"},{"surface":"நோக்கினென்","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கினென்","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"I looked at"}],"gloss":"I looked at"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பண்டை","parts":[{"text":"பண்டை","lemma":"பண்டை","gloss":"former"}],"gloss":"former"},{"surface":"அற்றோ","parts":[{"text":"அற்று","lemma":"அற்று","gloss":"like that"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is it like that?"},{"surface":"கண்டிசின்","parts":[{"text":"கண்டிசின்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"look"}],"gloss":"look!"},{"surface":"நுதலே","parts":[{"text":"நுதலே","lemma":"நுதல்","gloss":"forehead-emphasis"}],"gloss":"the forehead indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the tree-crowded forest where flocks of peacocks call / where grey-faced black monkeys shiver with their young ones / in the country of the lord of the slopes where heavy rain poured / I looked at his hill, O friend! / Look at my forehead, is it like it was in the old days?","translation":"In the tree-dense forest where flocks of peacocks call, and grey-faced black monkeys shiver with their young as heavy rains pour on the mountain slopes of his land, I looked at his hill, my friend. Look at my forehead now! Has it not returned to its beautiful old state?","modern":"மயில்களின் கூட்டங்கள் கூவுகின்ற, மரங்கள் நிறைந்த காட்டில், நரைத்த முகத்தைக் கொண்ட கருங்குரங்குகள் தம் குட்டிகளுடன் நடுங்கும்படி பெருமழை பொழியும் மலைச்சாரலை உடைய தலைவனின் நாட்டு மலையை நான் பார்த்தேன், தோழி! என் நெற்றியைப் பார்; அது முன்பு இருந்ததைப் போலப் பசலை நீங்கி அழகாக மாறிவிட்டது அல்லவா!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend after catching sight of her lover's mountain. She explains that her deep distress and the paleness (pasalai) on her face have completely vanished just by looking at his hill. The cold, wet mountain slopes of the Kuriñci landscape are described with shivering monkeys and calling peacocks, representing the heavy rains of the season. This imagery reflects the protective and nourishing presence of the lover, whose very land brings warmth and life back to the heroine. Her forehead, which had lost its luster during their separation, has now regained its former beauty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.87,1.07],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.2],[2.2,3.08],[3.08,3.6],[3.6,4.22],[4.22,4.4],[4.4,5.5],[5.5,5.6],[5.6,6.5],[6.5,7.08],[7.08,7.08],[7.08,7.08],[7.08,7.9],[7.9,8.6],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.6],[9.6,9.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.18],[1.3,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.46],[3.46,3.7],[3.7,4.2],[4.2,5.03],[5.03,5.24],[5.45,6.28],[6.28,6.9],[6.9,7.52],[7.64,8.0],[8.0,8.6],[8.6,9.0],[9.0,10.0],[10.07,10.38],[10.6,11.0],[11.0,11.1]]}}